  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.ISaveService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Interface for save service that handles both file operations and business logic
Provides clean separation between low-level file I/O and high-level save operations
Supports both regular saves and autosaves with automatic file management</p>
</div>
